## 📐 Key Measurements (Editorial Scale)

- **Font card:** 320x400px (generous)
- **Preview text:** 56px size
- **Metric labels:** 13px (readable)
- **Spacing:** 24px base unit (airy)
- **Border radius:** 2-4px (minimal)
- **Border width:** 1px standard, 0.5px hairline
- **Animation:** 300-400ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0.0, 0.2, 1)
- **Hover lift:** 2px translateY
- **Grid gap:** 32px horizontal, 40px vertical

